tion" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240437}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "b99af0d8-b75f-54bf-9697-c5d904e35653" :question/math-academy-id "q-105152" :question/problem "Find $h$, if $3{a}_{1}+h{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $h$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{a}_{1}+h{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+h\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ h\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ h\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $h=2.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240985 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e50e51d-23eb-52c3-9024-a155dbcb84d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238599} {:answer/id #uuid "47f8e849-3b9d-567e-a60c-02d76b96bff7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238681} {:answer/id #uuid "65cf35a9-f5a8-57f6-9ae1-12945a1cfe78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238945} {:answer/id #uuid "f32999ff-ea41-5018-8e37-5fc7900e986b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240199} {:answer/id #uuid "fcf14835-4d02-58b4-9f69-fea39453dad5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240289}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238681} :answer-field/id #uuid "5deddcca-b475-5a82-9e89-09dc2f28ecf3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240503}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "ab1a2dbb-2f20-5b38-9d5d-1509f7f1ce65" :question/math-academy-id "q-105154" :question/problem "Find $m$, if $7{a}_{1}+m{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $m$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}7{a}_{1}+m{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 7\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}+m\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ m\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}-7\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ m\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-15 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $m=-5.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186314967 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "741fb66b-3c95-5e3f-97d8-1d622c179c77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312899} {:answer/id #uuid "a00e943c-dce5-5328-838e-67cbbde69469" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313234} {:answer/id #uuid "bcfd1363-2dc4-5697-89d7-e836d86cd1f0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313451} {:answer/id #uuid "e1471d01-84a3-5d08-a011-92c14092e267" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313749} {:answer/id #uuid "ecb77f81-e06a-53ad-9d1f-4be8c7d1e7ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313865}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186313234} :answer-field/id #uuid "f015a2f9-b1d2-5717-a774-3e1dd65acf95" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314670}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "3910d8c3-7517-5b80-9efc-a8b60965d481" :question/math-academy-id "q-34051" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $2{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}11 \\\\ -7 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}-2\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ -12\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $k=-3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186317257 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "33982a47-2adf-5799-8859-c34bed20a404" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315422} {:answer/id #uuid "5687a31f-ebd2-5317-b3f8-3e2eae8a8565" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315615} {:answer/id #uuid "93d32481-f69e-5005-9fba-39aac45998ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315942} {:answer/id #uuid "e65cf7c4-b06f-5fb6-ae22-a85e