properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $s$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{a}_{1}+s{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+s\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ s\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}13 \\\\ 6 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ s\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ 0 \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $s=4.$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "33586620-e110-5a37-874f-a92103c5e9fb" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048673} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049814}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186542367 :question-generator/id #uuid "654ebed8-c886-576a-ae1a-ac9f64553608" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186119805.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120311 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "71a2d12d-063a-5194-9872-f086deecbe0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315764} {:answer/id #uuid "b4f678bb-2e13-5906-beb2-95f91613edbc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316142} {:answer/id #uuid "bb7b29bb-fb40-5f35-9053-65e121e4652d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316178} {:answer/id #uuid "d2e1a508-e59e-5b25-8a42-ad3fef836d28" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316300} {:answer/id #uuid "e70bee55-c24c-5ab5-a2eb-41d32eb5308c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316398}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186316142} :answer-field/id #uuid "516df2c1-bc97-57b4-8d44-e9fd43aa5d6c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316734}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "4e441944-ad54-59d2-9897-793ac5452b92" :question/math-academy-id "q-34249" :question/problem "Find $l$, if $5{a}_{1}+l{a}_{2}=b$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}45 \\\\ -20 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 19\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $l$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{a}_{1}+l{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 5\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix}+l\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}45 \\\\ -20 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 19\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ l\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}45 \\\\ -20 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 19\\end{bmatrix}-5\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 7\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ l\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -10 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -16\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $l=-2.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120312 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c1798df1-6455-5f91-b2e6-5591c12e2277" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118012} {:answer/id #uuid "dc6d4f97-9351-52f8-bee1-e1b671959955" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118013} {:answer/id #uuid "2c3aa656-e377-53ef-9901-4c3e0618b9c1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118014} {:answer/id #uuid "61be6fad-5ba4-5c22-9514-ba1a6223cb34" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186118015} {:answer/id #uuid "7f440688-ad7a-5912-8bf3-f37679f02f