egin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $h$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{a}_{1}+h{a}_{2} & =b \\\\ 3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+h\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ h\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 14 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}-3\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ h\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 8 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the final equation above, we can tell that $h=2.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240985 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3e50e51d-23eb-52c3-9024-a155dbcb84d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238599} {:answer/id #uuid "47f8e849-3b9d-567e-a60c-02d76b96bff7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238681} {:answer/id #uuid "65cf35a9-f5a8-57f6-9ae1-12945a1cfe78" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238945} {:answer/id #uuid "f32999ff-ea41-5018-8e37-5fc7900e986b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240199} {:answer/id #uuid "fcf14835-4d02-58b4-9f69-fea39453dad5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240289}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238681} :answer-field/id #uuid "5deddcca-b475-5a82-9e89-09dc2f28ecf3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240503}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "ab1a2dbb-2f20-5b38-9d5d-1509f7f1ce65" :question/math-academy-id