\n\\begin{aligned}6\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-30 \\\\ 18\\end{bmatrix}\\ne \\begin{bmatrix}-30 \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, there is no $m$ such that $5{a}_{1}+m{a}_{2}=0.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186542353 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "365204f8-31e6-509e-8b3e-73bff697b87f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542356} {:answer/id #uuid "5193fc94-1fae-5576-bfe5-8f590ea83705" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542357} {:answer/id #uuid "92f9f537-f77f-503e-8c68-a1a4463ea057" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542360} {:answer/id #uuid "d33f0b21-af08-5a91-8277-e939e9be58e7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542363} {:answer/id #uuid "e4148492-3d01-5833-8d57-101179a1f8da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542365}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186542363} :answer-field/id #uuid "66e335b9-f9ab-56d6-a2bc-fa7e7ca2fce7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186542358}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "036a544e-adcf-5604-8565-d9b2d689152b" :question/problem "Find $k$, if $4{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2}=0$ and\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate the $k$ term, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{a}_{1}+k{a}_{2} & =0 \\\\ 4\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+k\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ k\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}-4\\begin{bma